new_big_atomic=allocates a fresh big-atomic cell
read=the read operation: a seqlock-style optimistic read, retried until the version is stable
write=the write operation: bump the version, copy, bump again
value=the abstract state of the cell -- the list of values a client owns
history_auth_own=authoritative ownership of the version history
history_frag_own=a fragment of the version history, pinning one version's contents
